WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:04.254
Every family has a Sunja in their life.

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:08.216
That one person

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.093
who set the foundation

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:11.636
for who you are now.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.557
The Sunja of my life is my mother.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:16.558
My grandmother.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.559
Mother.

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:18.727
My grandfather.

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.145
My mom and dad.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:21.771
My previous generation.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.816
They all sacrificed
for the second generation.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:29.404
My mom's done so much for the family.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:31.740
She's put everyone first,
before herself.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:33.700
[My mother's] so strong and lovely...

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.829
And somehow I get a lump in my throat
just thinking of her.

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:41.124
My grandmother is around Sunja's age.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:43.626
Whenever I visited her,

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:46.421
she used to tell me stories

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:48.089
about the things she had to go through.

00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:51.885
She's sacrificed a lot.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:55.138
I personally wanted to portray
my grandmother 

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:59.726
and all the women from her generation.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.144
Papa!

00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:02.437
I think about...

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.564
Who are the people
that came before me,

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:05.940
but without them,

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.651
I would not be who I am now?

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:14.532
I hope this show prompts
similar curiosity in viewers.

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:17.869
I think when people watch this show,

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:19.412
it will be so inevitable.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.625
Like, "I know Sunja."

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:27.003
[Music playing]

